  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LTTvOp5L/images/2b37126dcef53cff8488de1a496c013b90103075.png\" alt=\"儲物樂\"></p>\n<p><strong>透過更多專為保持整潔而設計的家具，提升您的建造體驗。</strong>改造您的廚房或任何空間，輕鬆整理您的必需品。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-delight-forge/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXy6vrX.png\" alt=\"Fabric 版本下載\" width=\"174\" height=\"36\"></a></p>\n<h2>🪵 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>抽屜</li>\n<li>帶門抽屜</li>\n<li>帶書抽屜</li>\n<li>小型抽屜</li>\n<li>帶門書架</li>\n<li>玻璃櫥櫃</li>\n<li>玻璃門櫥櫃</li>\n<li>單門櫥櫃</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"存錢買筆電中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"贊助按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐贈按鈕\"></a></p>",
